#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Topic-Keys/Topic-Keys-Tutorial.rst:435
msgid ""
"It is important to note that this initial approach is not the most efficient "
"one, as it entails the creation of multiple topics, publishers, and "
"subscriptions. Furthermore, apart from being inefficient, it also makes the "
"application more complex, harder to maintain, and resource demanding. "
"Moreover, as a consequence of creating far more entities than needed, the "
"application incurs in an unnecessary discovery overhead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Topic-Keys/Topic-Keys-Tutorial.rst:439
msgid ""
"Lets go a step further. In this second approach a single topic is used in "
"which all the sensors will publish their data (without using a keyed topic). "
"Run the demo by executing the following commands in separate terminals:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Topic-Keys/Topic-Keys-Tutorial.rst:451
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Topic-Keys/Topic-Keys-Tutorial.rst:470
